  "details": "Right now when you set the volume of a user who's always too loud to a lower volume (or also raise the volume of specific people), you have to set that each time you restart VRChat and see them again.\n\nIt would be great if VRChat could remember the volume setting, just as it is already persisting user settings like being muted or whether there avatar is shown or not.",
